HOW TO EXTRACT DRM KEYS AND MANIFEST
Requirements:
Access to the livestream over browser
PC

Get WidevineProxy2

https://github.com/DevLARLEY/WidevineProxy2 Download the latest release from here
Install it to Chrome:
Go to the extensions tab;
Enable developer
Extract the zipped extension to a folder and install it.
Configure WidevineProxy2
Open the extension;
Enable it
Under 'Widevine Device' click 'Choose File' and insert the file i attached into this forum.

Open the Live TV Site

When the live stream runs, go to the extension, click the '+' next to the URL you viewed the live stream from.
Get the Keys and manifest. You should then have the neccessary keys to restream/play the stream. 
